1
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:47,750
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,410 --> 00:01:50,910
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,070
Jiaoqi, try this.

4
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,160
Just eat your food.

5
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,160
There's a new one.

6
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:01,760
I'm full.

7
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,310
Jiaoqi, when do you think the sea monster

8
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:08,680
will appear again?

9
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,960
Keep your voice down.

10
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,600
Don't talk that loud.

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,260
Isn't it too obvious for him to sit there?

12
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,940
Hello, sir. What would you like?

13
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:18,710
No, thanks. I brought food.

14
00:02:19,070 --> 00:02:20,280
This area is for customers.

15
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,210
No outside food.

16
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,680
Then I'll order the cheapest one.

17
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,030
Okay.

18
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,030
Let's go once we're full.

19
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,100
I saw him.

20
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:39,130
Hello, sir.

21
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:40,870
Your Super Pearl.

22
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:42,710
This again?

23
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,060
Scan the code here.

24
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:45,280
How much?

25
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:46,050
70 yuan.

26
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,480
Yours is 10 yuan more expensive.

27
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,070
Okay, I paid.

28
00:02:56,170 --> 00:02:57,680
Why is the foam

29
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,910
from the waves white?

30
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,520
It must have something to do
with the water quality.

31
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,120
Is that so?

32
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,520
Don't look.

33
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,800
Do you remember what I just told you?

34
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:30,520
We'll leave the village in a while.

35
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,960
Leave the village in a while?

36
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:35,560
Jiaoqi, where exactly
is that thing hidden?

37
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,220
Isn't that thing hidden in...

38
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,470
Stop talking. Someone might hear us.

39
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:40,000
Let's go.

40
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:44,240
Wait, Jiaoqi.

41
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,360
I want to take a picture with him.

42
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,240
Hurry up.

43
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,280
Cheese.

44
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,800
Let's go.

45
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,680
This way, Jiaoqi.

46
00:04:10,510 --> 00:04:12,900
Hey, bro. I've caught you three times.

47
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:15,360
Stay over there. This is my turf.

48
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,390
No, your area is over there.

49
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,870
Can you stop coming here?

50
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:22,830
Why don't you listen?

51
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,630
Why are they fighting?

52
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,810
Let's wait for him.

53
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,950
Well, Jiaoqi,

54
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,510
why did Shapu Village

55
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:44,310
send a fool to follow us?

56
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,560
We have to pretend
not to notice him every time.

57
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:54,159
-It's too hard.
-We always have to wait for him.

58
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:56,310
Don't look back. Keep acting.

59
00:04:59,870 --> 00:05:00,510
The sea...

60
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:05,000
Come on!

61
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:11,200
What is he doing now?

62
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,000
Forget it. Let's follow him.

63
00:05:26,450 --> 00:05:27,570
This weather...

64
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,520
Bro, do you have a tissue?

65
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,720
Never mind if you don't.

66
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,680
Who is this?

67
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:50,270
Wait, isn't Zhou Ke supposed to be
in the orange dinosaur?

68
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:50,800
Exactly.

69
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:54,400
I thought he was the orange dinosaur.
Turns out he's the green...

70
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,130
Green...

71
00:05:56,310 --> 00:05:57,600
Why are there so many orange dinosaurs?

72
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,870
Which one is him?

73
00:05:58,870 --> 00:05:59,330
Well...

74
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:02,310
Hello?

75
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,480
We've tried our best!

76
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,830
It's too hard to pretend
to be followed by him.

77
00:06:06,830 --> 00:06:07,360
What?

78
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,190
You lost him?

79
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,600
Did you walk too fast?

80
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:12,480
I don't care.

81
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,560
Find Zhou Ke immediately

82
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,290
and let him keep following you.

83
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:18,560
Okay, let's go back and look for him.

84
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:21,430
Let's go.

85
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,600
How did we lose track of him?

86
00:06:38,150 --> 00:06:38,800
Oh, no.

87
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,800
How did I lose them?

88
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,790
[Chasing Wind by the Shapu Beach
for Tranquility]

89
00:06:46,950 --> 00:06:55,770
[Zhen's Fish Ball]

90
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:52,870
Zhen,

91
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:55,430
why are you sitting here alone

92
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:56,430
looking so down?

93
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,890
Fewer people have come
to the village lately.

94
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,190
Is it because

95
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:04,320
they don't like my fish balls anymore?

96
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,600
And Zhou Ke.

97
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:07,720
I wonder how he's doing now.

98
00:07:10,390 --> 00:07:11,830
Don't worry about Zhou Ke.

99
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:13,230
We're still here, right?

100
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:14,800
These days,

101
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,310
I've come up with some new ideas

102
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:17,860
about Zhen's Fish Ball.

103
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,400
I think we can add a few categories.

104
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,750
For example, those freshly

105
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:24,160
caught fish

106
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:26,680
can be used to make sashimi.
("sashimi" sounds like "rest of my life")

107
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,920
That way, I can sell

108
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,300
fish balls with you

109
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,750
for the rest of my life.

110
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:32,750
But I don't know how to make sashimi.

111
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:35,310
Then we can add some desserts.

112
00:07:35,310 --> 00:07:37,110
Do you know how to make desserts?

113
00:07:39,150 --> 00:07:40,190
That's weird.

114
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:42,070
Then why every time

115
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:43,560
you like my Moments posts,

116
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,560
I feel like I'm eating a sweet donut?

117
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:47,680
I don't know how to make any of those.

118
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:49,330
I can only make fish balls.

119
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,950
How about I try some new flavors?

120
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,000
No.

121
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:55,090
Nothing beats the flavors

122
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,680
you grew up with.

123
00:07:58,430 --> 00:07:59,950
You're more familiar with them

124
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:01,120
and know them well.

125
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,600
Old flavors are the best.

126
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,070
Do you remember
the time that we sneaked out to sea

127
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:09,950
when we were kids?

128
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:13,310
We drifted from morning to dusk,

129
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:17,510
but we saw the most beautiful
sunset that day.

130
00:08:18,270 --> 00:08:19,470
The sky was full of...

131
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:23,120
The sky was full of sunset glow,

132
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:25,310
burning like fire.

133
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:26,630
Wait, why are you here?

134
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:29,000
It's a public area. Why can't I be here?

135
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,480
I'm chatting with Zhen.

136
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:33,799
Let's chat together. It'll be fun.

137
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,200
We're talking about our childhoods.

138
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,210
I was also a child.

139
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,600
Everyone has a childhood.
Let's chat together.

140
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,240
Right?

141
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,240
Ours might be a bit different.

142
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,840
Why are they different?

143
00:08:46,270 --> 00:08:47,870
Keep talking. I'm so curious. Go ahead.

144
00:08:47,870 --> 00:08:48,330
Well...

145
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,630
Look, you're blushing.

146
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:52,120
Are you shy?

147
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,840
Look at you.

148
00:08:54,150 --> 00:08:55,240
Then I'll talk.

149
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,360
When I was little,

150
00:08:58,510 --> 00:09:00,510
I loved going to my grandma's house.

151
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,600
There were two chickens

152
00:09:02,670 --> 00:09:04,070
in my grandma's village,

153
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,150
one rooster and one hen.

154
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:08,030
They were so close,

155
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:09,360
a perfect match.

156
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,480
One day,

157
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:14,970
the rooster wanted to take a stroll
in the next village,

158
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,200
and then a weasel

159
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,080
tried to steal the hen.

160
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:21,390
Fortunately,

161
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,850
a big yellow dog was watching over her.

162
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,670
What if no one was watching?

163
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:29,510
And then?

164
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,260
The big yellow dog?

165
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,390
Wait, why are you here?

166
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,360
It's a public area. Why can't I be here?

167
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,600
We're chatting here.

168
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,600
Let's chat together. It'll be fun.

169
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:44,840
We're talking about our childhoods.
Don't bother us.

170
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,880
My childhood was miserable.

171
00:09:47,030 --> 00:09:48,030
-Let's talk.
-Whether it was miserable or not,

172
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,150
we can talk about it later.

173
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,030
Well, you...

174
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,150
you should leave.

175
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:52,150
I have something important to do.
You should go.

176
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:54,030
Is something wrong with your eyes?

177
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,030
What are you talking about?

178
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:55,960
Your eyes... No.

179
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,510
-Look at those big eyes. What's wrong?
-Don't...

180
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,240
Stop looking at my eyes.

181
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,550
Look at those big eyes.
They have to be fine.

182
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:00,320
Chen Junnan...

183
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,390
Why are your eyes uncomfortable?

184
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:03,270
Zhen, try new flavors.

185
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:04,470
Zhen, new flavors...

186
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,200
I just can't relate

187
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,510
to the folks here.

188
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,110
What did you just say?

189
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:19,240
I just can't relate

190
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,720
to the folks here.

191
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,960
["Folks" Sounds Like "Puffer"]

192
00:10:21,670 --> 00:10:22,360
Thanks!

193
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,040
I know what to do now!

194
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:25,450
What are you doing?

195
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:26,550
Buying fish!

196
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,240
Folks here?

197
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:43,440
No...

198
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,400
I won't eat it.

199
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,080
How is it?

200
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:54,170
It tastes like dreams.

201
00:10:57,600 --> 00:11:00,660
Zhen, actually, I didn't want
to talk about fish balls.

202
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:02,940
I wanted to say we could start...

203
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:06,240
We could start...

204
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,270
A-Are you okay?

205
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,000
I...

206
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:14,490
You're foaming...

207
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:16,900
Oh, no.

208
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,160
Are the fish balls undercooked?

209
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,200
Are you okay?

210
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:28,000
I'm fine.

211
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,240
This bowl of fish balls can't go wrong.

212
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,150
Eat some to build up your strength.

213
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:32,120
No, thanks.

214
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,910
Zhen,

215
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:36,030
actually, I didn't want
to talk about fish balls.

216
00:11:36,030 --> 00:11:38,720
Do you remember
when we played house as kids?

217
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,170
I played the dad,

218
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,380
you played the mom,

219
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,210
and Jiahao played the dog.

220
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
What a happy family.

221
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,440
Actually,

222
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:52,330
I've always wanted a home.

223
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:55,910
Living abroad,
I was constantly moving around.

224
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,910
I'd move in one night

225
00:11:57,930 --> 00:11:59,000
and move out the next.

226
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,070
I've really had enough!

227
00:12:00,070 --> 00:12:00,870
Wait a minute.

228
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,960
What did you just say?

229
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,000
I've had enough.

230
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,090
Before that.

231
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,550
I'd move in one night...

232
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,920
The next line.

233
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,520
And move out the next.

234
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,720
Half price for the next bowl!

235
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,120
Bingqiang, thank you so much!

236
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:15,960
Thank you!

237
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,330
Are you okay?

238
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,120
I'm fine.

239
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,880
It's just blood backflow.

240
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,570
You're so smart! Thank you!

241
00:12:24,570 --> 00:12:25,210
I got it!

242
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:28,550
Half price

243
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,750
for the next bowl?

244
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,320
She's so cute.

245
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:42,580
So,

246
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,360
Mr. Zhou came up with a brilliant plan.

247
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:47,270
He held a funeral

248
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:50,200
for my sister!

249
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,960
Wait.

250
00:12:56,150 --> 00:12:57,960
Can you get to the point?

251
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,390
What exactly is their relationship?

252
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,610
What relationship?

253
00:13:01,790 --> 00:13:02,550
Just...

254
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:05,220
the creditor and the debtor?

255
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,440
Did Zhen borrow money from him?

256
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,720
No, Mr. Zhou Ke owed someone money,

257
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,520
and my sister paid it off for him.

258
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,600
Zhen is always stingy,

259
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,850
and she paid off Zhou Ke's debt?

260
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,670
Then she made me pay to live here?

261
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:20,720
So, I'm basically paying off his debt.

262
00:13:23,910 --> 00:13:24,870
That's right.

263
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,120
Well,

264
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,720
I...

265
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,670
I should thank you
on behalf of Mr. Zhou Ke.

266
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,470
Wait a minute.

267
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,910
In Zhen's heart,

268
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,360
is Zhou Ke more important than me now?

269
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:37,550
Impossible! No way!

270
00:13:37,730 --> 00:13:39,640
You two are childhood sweethearts.

271
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:40,550
They've only...

272
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:42,600
They've only known each other
for a few days.

273
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,600
Look, last night,

274
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,550
Zhen was a bit confused,

275
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:47,150
and I told her to ask someone clever.

276
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:48,440
Then she asked you, didn't she?

277
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,770
She looks totally fine and energetic now.

278
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:52,410
What did you say to her?

279
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,790
I just gave her some simple advice.

280
00:13:56,790 --> 00:13:58,600
See? Only you can help her.

281
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,770
I told you he's useless.

282
00:14:05,150 --> 00:14:06,440
He's too stupid.

283
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:09,200
So useless. How could he lose track?

284
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:10,910
How did he lose track?

285
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:11,960
I told you he...

286
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:14,790
Stop!

287
00:14:14,810 --> 00:14:15,610
What's wrong?

288
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,960
Was that Zhou Ke?

289
00:14:24,390 --> 00:14:26,360
It must be somewhere around here.

290
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,790
Get out and help me look for it.

291
00:14:27,790 --> 00:14:30,150
How could it drop on the road?

292
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,480
-Is it there?
-No.

293
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:33,200
Then check the trunk.

294
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,920
It's not in the trunk either.

295
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,120
Found it. It's in the car.

296
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,910
You found it?

297
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:44,120
Then why did you make me look around?

298
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:45,360
Close the trunk.

299
00:14:48,870 --> 00:14:50,240
Now that we've found it, let's go.

300
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:50,960
Let's go.

301
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:56,000
Am I getting old?

302
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,240
I'm so forgetful.

303
00:15:17,030 --> 00:15:18,630
He's really got some nerve.

304
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:21,000
How could he fall asleep in the trunk
while tailing us?

305
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,390
It's mainly because I drove too smoothly.

306
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:23,120
Come on.

307
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:25,240
How many times did you stall the engine?

308
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,080
Perhaps you made him carsick
from all the bumping.

309
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,360
I had to drift on mountain roads.

310
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,630
Otherwise, how could I pass
five consecutive hairpin turns?

311
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,840
Okay, drop it.

312
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,370
Let's go.

313
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:33,200
Well,

314
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:34,240
if we leave,

315
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,240
what if he wakes up and can't find us?

316
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:37,970
I've figured it out.

317
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,940
We'll leave a mark for him.

318
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:54,870
Done.

319
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:58,000
We'll leave this fake sea monster here.

320
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,440
Let's find a place to hide.

321
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:01,200
When Zhou Ke wakes up

322
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,770
and pulls this fake sea monster up,

323
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,320
the reporters and influencers I contacted

324
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,200
in advance

325
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,960
will come with their phones and cameras

326
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,020
and take pictures.

327
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:11,470
With photos as proof,

328
00:16:11,790 --> 00:16:14,030
Zhou Ke will be the one
who put the fake sea monster here,

329
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:16,270
and he'll never be able to clear his name.

330
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:17,270
Jiaoqi, you have connections

331
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:19,130
with reporters and influencers?

332
00:16:19,970 --> 00:16:21,790
I posted something online anonymously

333
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:23,030
as a concerned citizen,

334
00:16:23,030 --> 00:16:24,390
saying there'd be
a sea monster here tonight.

335
00:16:24,390 --> 00:16:25,190
Wait, Jiaoqi,

336
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:26,670
I'm a bit confused.

337
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,960
Chuanao Village's

338
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,840
sea monster business
just started taking off.

339
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,480
Why are we exposing it?

340
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,240
Our goal isn't to help Chuanao Village

341
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,700
but to ruin Shapu Village.

342
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,020
How long can we hide

343
00:16:37,270 --> 00:16:38,350
the truth about the sea monster?

344
00:16:38,350 --> 00:16:40,200
We're in a dilemma right now.

345
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:42,440
So, why don't we use this opportunity

346
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,440
to shift the blame

347
00:16:43,970 --> 00:16:45,030
to Zhou Ke.

348
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,080
We'll say the people of Shapu Village

349
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,000
sent someone to make a fake sea monster

350
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,440
and frame Chuanao Village.

351
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:52,300
Their reputation will be ruined,

352
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,700
no tourists will come,

353
00:16:53,870 --> 00:16:55,120
their economy will fail,

354
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:57,920
and we can naturally
proceed with the demolition.

355
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:00,760
You have great vision, Jiaoqi.

356
00:17:14,069 --> 00:17:15,640
Which plot from
the Three Kingdoms is this?

357
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:16,839
The fake Monkey King.

358
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,200
The fake Monkey King?

359
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:20,750
Jiaoqi.

360
00:17:25,069 --> 00:17:25,920
Jiaoqi!

361
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:27,829
Why is this sea monster dragging us away?

362
00:17:27,829 --> 00:17:28,960
This sea monster...

363
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:31,750
Help! The sea monster is back to life!

364
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:33,960
Help! The sea monster is back to life!

365
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:34,920
Help!

366
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,270
Jiaoqi!

367
00:17:38,510 --> 00:17:39,480
Jiaoqi, help!

368
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,210
The sea monster wants to eat me!

369
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,000
Help!

370
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,200
Help!

371
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:03,730
[Trending Searches]

372
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:08,710
[The Sea Monster
from Chuanao Village Eats People]

373
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,730
The sea monster ate people!

374
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,770
The sea monster ate people!

375
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:19,970
The sea monster is real...

376
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:21,160
It ate people!

377
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:25,920
Wh-What's real?

378
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:26,720
The sea monster...

379
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:27,720
The sea...

380
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,590
Listen, take your time.

381
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:30,400
What did you see?

382
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,400
The sea...

383
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,720
I saw the sea monster...

384
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,110
eat...

385
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:35,000
I saw the monster eat them.

386
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,480
How's that possible?

387
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,240
Use your brain.

388
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,480
Maybe they were just
putting on a show for you.

389
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,440
Well... I...

390
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,680
I saw it eat... I saw...

391
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,240
Th-They were eaten...

392
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:44,960
Really...

393
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,290
They were really eaten.

394
00:18:51,030 --> 00:18:53,070
That's what happened.

395
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,160
That's the situation.

396
00:18:58,110 --> 00:18:59,110
So, are you saying

397
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,500
there really was a sea monster there?

398
00:19:03,110 --> 00:19:04,550
Wait, I didn't get it.

399
00:19:04,750 --> 00:19:06,310
You mean someone was...

400
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,510
Someone was...

401
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:11,110
Someone from here
was eaten by the sea monster?

402
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:12,880
Maybe two.

403
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,510
I saw them get dragged into the sea
by the monster.

404
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:17,480
They were thrashing around in the water,

405
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,790
and then they disappeared.

406
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:19,830
There were a lot of people there.

407
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:20,440
They all saw it.

408
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,720
You have no idea how crazy it was.

409
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:22,920
Oh my god.

410
00:19:23,650 --> 00:19:25,180
It's okay. Don't be scared.

411
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:27,880
Jiaoqi,

412
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,690
will he silence us for good?

413
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,160
No way.

414
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,740
We're kind of a big deal after all.

415
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:36,720
Useless!

416
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,310
If I hadn't been watching in the dark

417
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:40,270
and saved you,

418
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,960
you would've died in the sea!

419
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,220
How could you be dragged in by this thing?

420
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,310
Well, the sea monster

421
00:19:46,310 --> 00:19:47,170
somehow moved.

422
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,880
Wasn't there a remote control?

423
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,200
It was already broken.

424
00:19:50,260 --> 00:19:52,990
Are you shifting the blame
to the remote control?

425
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:53,970
Secretary Liu,

426
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,270
now all the netizens are saying
the sea monster is real.

427
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:57,510
What should we do next?

428
00:19:57,510 --> 00:19:59,480
Now that they think it's real,

429
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:01,550
we'll just play along.

430
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,350
You two,

431
00:20:04,110 --> 00:20:06,240
make this fake sea monster disappear.

432
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,720
Hide it in

433
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:09,830
a secret place

434
00:20:10,550 --> 00:20:11,640
and bury

435
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:12,990
the truth.

436
00:20:13,270 --> 00:20:14,160
Then it'll be

437
00:20:15,030 --> 00:20:15,680
a crime

438
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,270
without evidence.

439
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,170
Understand?

440
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:20,680
You love the Light On series, don't you?

441
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,880
Cut the crap!

442
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,790
Can you even understand it?

443
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:24,920
Loser!

444
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:27,750
Little loser!

445
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Get lost.

446
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,270
Come to the village committee now!

447
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:44,160
I know! I'll solve this problem!

448
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,440
I'm trying to solve this!

449
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:46,490
Please wait...

450
00:20:53,030 --> 00:20:53,490
Well...

451
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,440
One at a time, okay?

452
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,000
One at a time!

453
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:56,440
Okay.

454
00:20:56,510 --> 00:20:57,830
There's a monster in the sea.

455
00:20:57,830 --> 00:20:59,750
Now we don't dare to go fishing.

456
00:20:59,790 --> 00:21:00,790
You didn't allow us to sell our houses,

457
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:02,680
insisting on leading us
to develop cultural tourism.

458
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,270
The marine tourism project
can't proceed either.

459
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:05,400
Now there's not a single

460
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,610
tourist in the village.

461
00:21:06,610 --> 00:21:07,310
Look at all this mess!

462
00:21:07,310 --> 00:21:08,400
What should we do?

463
00:21:08,420 --> 00:21:10,950
Do you deserve to be
the acting village chief?

464
00:21:14,290 --> 00:21:14,830
Listen...

465
00:21:14,830 --> 00:21:15,880
Don't move! Sit still!

466
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,240
Haidan went out fishing yesterday

467
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:18,610
and hasn't come back yet!

468
00:21:18,610 --> 00:21:19,880
Then go look for him!

469
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,160
Find Mr. Haidan.

470
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,480
What should we do?

471
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,200
Where's Zhen?

472
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,680
You can't solve anything.

473
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:25,510
We want Zhen back!

474
00:21:25,510 --> 00:21:26,310
Where's Zhen?

475
00:21:26,510 --> 00:21:27,920
Where's the money?

476
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:29,160
Where's our money?

477
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,110
Bingqiang is here!

478
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,550
Bingqiang knows what to do!

479
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:35,440
Bingqiang.

480
00:21:35,590 --> 00:21:36,400
Bingqiang can solve this.

481
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,830
Bingqiang, what do you think we should do?

482
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:38,200
Exactly!

483
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,160
Dear friends,

484
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:43,640
no one could foresee
the appearance of the monster,

485
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:45,030
right?

486
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:46,000
Yes.

487
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,640
But one thing is for sure,

488
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,920
I always have a plan B.

489
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:52,000
What plan B? What does that mean?

490
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,590
Now, your greatest concern is that

491
00:21:54,590 --> 00:21:56,830
you can't go fishing
because of the sea monster, right?

492
00:21:56,830 --> 00:21:58,310
Exactly!

493
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,790
But isn't this a good thing?

494
00:22:01,510 --> 00:22:03,070
How is this a good thing?

495
00:22:03,070 --> 00:22:05,200
Is the sea monster
raised by Chuanao Village?

496
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,880
No.

497
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:09,030
The sea is connected.

498
00:22:09,050 --> 00:22:09,620
Yes.

499
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:12,960
Chuanao Village claims to be
the hometown of the sea monster,

500
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,110
so why can't we?

501
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:17,310
That makes sense.

502
00:22:17,310 --> 00:22:18,270
That's right!

503
00:22:18,550 --> 00:22:19,110
Look,

504
00:22:19,590 --> 00:22:22,200
I'll come up with a complete plan tonight,

505
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,960
and I'll show it to you tomorrow.

506
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:27,510
Okay!

507
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,970
Everyone, you can go home!

508
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:30,550
Go home!

509
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,350
That's how it should be! So beautiful!

510
00:22:37,270 --> 00:22:37,800
Exactly.

511
00:22:38,750 --> 00:22:39,550
That's right.

512
00:22:40,070 --> 00:22:41,930
You're an incredible artisan...

513
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:46,240
Or maybe not.

514
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,310
Mr. Maling. Mr. Maling.

515
00:22:50,310 --> 00:22:51,790
Stop for a moment, Mr. Maling.

516
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:53,200
What are you making?

517
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:54,630
Is this a potato?

518
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:57,960
This is the submarine I built, Unit 0.

519
00:22:58,640 --> 00:22:59,350
Inside,

520
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:02,150
it uses a ship-grade
turbocharged propeller.

521
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:04,270
And on the outside, I used cans

522
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:06,790
to express my respect
for environmentalism.

523
00:23:06,790 --> 00:23:09,720
Mr. Maling, I admire your commitment

524
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:10,640
to protecting the environment,

525
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:13,510
but it doesn't look like a sea monster.

526
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:15,510
Why should it look like a sea monster?

527
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:17,270
Here's the thing, Mr. Maling.

528
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:19,480
We urgently need a submarine

529
00:23:19,590 --> 00:23:21,350
that looks like a sea monster

530
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:23,770
to attract tourists to Shapu Village.

531
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:27,350
One and a half days. Leave it to me.

532
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:32,710
Mr. Maling, I'll be waiting
for your good news.

533
00:23:34,380 --> 00:23:36,060
Sea monster. It's big.

534
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:44,180
[Shapu Village,
Hometown of the Sea Monster]

535
00:23:58,130 --> 00:24:01,290
[Chuanao Village]

536
00:24:07,490 --> 00:24:08,950
[Sea Monster Village]

537
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:19,590
Do you want it?

538
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:20,590
No.

539
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:22,200
You don't want it?

540
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:23,830
Play.

541
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,390
What's going on?

542
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:42,370
We haven't seen a single tourist for days.

543
00:24:42,470 --> 00:24:43,270
Unless...

544
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:45,060
a real sea monster comes here,

545
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,940
no one will believe it.

546
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:49,440
It's not a big deal!

547
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,930
I'll just play the sea monster.

548
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:55,760
The little sea monster is here!

549
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,790
Stop joking.

550
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:01,110
How can you laugh at a time like this?

551
00:25:01,110 --> 00:25:02,400
Are you heartless?

552
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,400
I'm just joking. I...

553
00:25:06,590 --> 00:25:07,030
Ximei!

554
00:25:09,820 --> 00:25:11,220
I think we should give up.

555
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:13,720
Maybe I should go back
and keep making fish balls.

556
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,830
Our village isn't the hometown
of the sea monster anyway.

557
00:25:15,830 --> 00:25:18,200
This isn't working at all.

558
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,610
Zhen, leave it to me.

559
00:25:20,740 --> 00:25:22,060
I will conquer fate.

560
00:25:22,860 --> 00:25:25,920
I promise I'll make a sea monster
appear in our village.

561
00:25:32,990 --> 00:25:34,050
Give me the sticks.

562
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:35,550
What sticks?

563
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:38,400
The nunchucks I gave you for self-defense.

564
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:40,920
Do you need them now?

565
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,920
Yes. I need to make fish balls.

566
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:45,200
Use something else to make them.

567
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:46,800
My dad passed them down to me.

568
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:48,750
Did you lose them?

569
00:25:50,510 --> 00:25:52,110
No. I have them.

570
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:53,880
I'll get them. Don't worry.

571
00:25:54,030 --> 00:25:54,830
I'll get them.

572
00:25:56,250 --> 00:25:58,050
If you lose them, you'll be dead.

573
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:02,960
Can't believe

574
00:26:03,350 --> 00:26:05,000
the sea monster is real.

575
00:26:05,480 --> 00:26:06,110
Exactly.

576
00:26:11,030 --> 00:26:12,350
Why are you so happy?

577
00:26:14,350 --> 00:26:16,000
There are so many visitors
in Chuanao Village.

578
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:16,960
It's packed.

579
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:18,090
Of course I'm happy.

580
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,830
What about Shapu Village?

581
00:26:19,830 --> 00:26:21,290
No one goes there anymore.

582
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:22,550
Honey,

583
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:25,360
we're about to have everything we want.

584
00:26:25,830 --> 00:26:26,310
Wait.

585
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:30,070
I feel something's off.

586
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:33,140
Everything's fine. Don't overthink it.

587
00:26:36,510 --> 00:26:37,490
Zhou Ke?

588
00:26:38,030 --> 00:26:39,230
Why is he calling you?

589
00:26:39,510 --> 00:26:40,550
How would I know?

590
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:41,800
Hello?

591
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:44,210
Ma Feiyan, where is my luggage?

592
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:45,640
How would I know

593
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,900
where your luggage is?

594
00:26:47,630 --> 00:26:48,590
Well, I'm at the warehouse.

595
00:26:48,590 --> 00:26:49,860
Why is it empty?

596
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:51,240
What warehouse?

597
00:26:52,030 --> 00:26:53,350
The warehouse-themed hotel.

598
00:26:53,350 --> 00:26:54,830
What themed hotel?

599
00:26:55,550 --> 00:26:56,880
Where are my nunchucks?

600
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:57,750
If you want nunchucks,

601
00:26:57,750 --> 00:26:58,480
go find Zhou Juelun.

602
00:26:58,480 --> 00:26:59,750
Why are you calling me?

603
00:26:59,750 --> 00:27:00,480
My nunchucks...

604
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:01,830
Psycho.

605
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:02,740
What did he say?

606
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:03,290
He...

607
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:05,590
He's looking for his nunchucks.

608
00:27:07,790 --> 00:27:08,960
I guess he was

609
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,400
scared out of his mind

610
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:12,370
after seeing the real sea monster.

611
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:14,830
Th-That's possible.

612
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:19,840
You're here.

613
00:27:21,270 --> 00:27:22,720
Based on Unit 0,

614
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,850
I've created Unit 2.

615
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,240
It's complete.

616
00:27:25,590 --> 00:27:26,450
Please come in.

617
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:28,830
Really?

618
00:27:33,110 --> 00:27:34,590
Mr. Maling,

619
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:36,720
can you stop doing this

620
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,050
shadow puppetry stuff?

621
00:27:55,350 --> 00:27:59,310
W-Was this modified

622
00:27:59,310 --> 00:28:00,350
based on Unit 0?

623
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:04,030
Or you could say it's built on Unit 0.

624
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:04,970
How is it?

625
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,920
It's amazing.

626
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:08,920
Can it go underwater?

627
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,900
I'll test it tomorrow.

628
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,480
519.

629
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:23,400
520.

630
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:24,830
Ximei.

631
00:28:26,070 --> 00:28:28,160
Thanks, but I can't eat.

632
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:30,090
Why are you unhappy?

633
00:28:32,070 --> 00:28:34,400
Zhou Ke and I came here

634
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:37,270
and started promoting cultural tourism
from scratch, right?

635
00:28:37,270 --> 00:28:38,800
We finally made it this far,

636
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:41,200
but Chuanao Village crushed us easily,

637
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:43,310
and we had no way to fight back.

638
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:45,240
And now there's even a sea monster.

639
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:46,750
What should we do?

640
00:28:47,310 --> 00:28:50,110
We're getting fewer and fewer tourists.

641
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:52,550
And you might still
have to demolish the houses.

642
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:53,880
I just feel sorry for Ke.

643
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:56,280
Yes, it's been really hard for him.

644
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:58,550
Eat something. Don't be mad.

645
00:28:58,550 --> 00:28:58,830
Eat something.

646
00:28:58,830 --> 00:28:59,960
No, I'm not eating!

647
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:01,720
All you do is tell me to eat!

648
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:04,350
You're a 5-foot man.

649
00:29:04,350 --> 00:29:05,830
Can't you do something to help?

650
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:07,000
First of all, Ximei,

651
00:29:07,640 --> 00:29:08,900
I'm taller than 5 feet.

652
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:11,510
Secondly, I did help.

653
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,110
Didn't I handle the supplies?

654
00:29:13,110 --> 00:29:14,510
Look at all this food and drink...

655
00:29:14,510 --> 00:29:15,550
Stop it.

656
00:29:15,550 --> 00:29:16,880
You call that supplies?

657
00:29:17,030 --> 00:29:19,110
That's Lin Ximei's exclusive supplies.

658
00:29:19,110 --> 00:29:21,310
All you do is feed me all the time.

659
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:23,350
Look at Bingqiang.

660
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:24,960
He's saved the day

661
00:29:25,550 --> 00:29:27,440
several times, hasn't he?

662
00:29:29,160 --> 00:29:29,820
And you said

663
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:31,960
he used to be your lackey.

664
00:29:32,510 --> 00:29:34,450
Look at how much he's done

665
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,270
for us!

666
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,350
Ximei.

667
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:39,000
What?

668
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,790
Your words just hurt me.

669
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:44,960
Fine.

670
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,510
I'll show you

671
00:29:46,890 --> 00:29:47,890
the real power

672
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:50,740
of the toughest man in Shapu Village.

673
00:30:19,070 --> 00:30:20,400
A fortune teller told me

674
00:30:20,580 --> 00:30:22,840
that my success would come at huge costs.

675
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:26,980
We run the streets,

676
00:30:28,310 --> 00:30:29,070
and our fate

677
00:30:31,350 --> 00:30:32,410
is in our own hands.

678
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:34,110
A few days ago,

679
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:37,890
at the Second Hand Pants concert
in Chuanao Village,

680
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:40,060
I risked my life to sell water.

681
00:30:40,750 --> 00:30:42,070
I didn't even sell 2 bottles,

682
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:43,160
and 200 people

683
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:47,270
chased me all the way
from Chuanao South Station

684
00:30:47,270 --> 00:30:48,830
to Funing North Station.

685
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,200
They went too far.

686
00:30:52,590 --> 00:30:54,120
Since they're so ruthless,

687
00:30:54,510 --> 00:30:56,370
don't blame me for fighting back.

688
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:59,150
You've been with me the longest,

689
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:02,280
and you have the dirtiest records.

690
00:31:03,500 --> 00:31:04,780
You chose this path.

691
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:09,750
Don't blame me.

692
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:23,920
Junnan...

693
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:30,540
For Shapu Village!

694
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:32,790
Shapu! Shapu!

695
00:31:33,510 --> 00:31:36,030
Shapu! Shapu!

696
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:38,240
Shapu! Shapu!

697
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,400
Cheers!

698
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,030
Cheers!

699
00:31:44,030 --> 00:31:44,750
Let's go!

700
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:45,590
Let's go!

701
00:31:45,610 --> 00:31:46,160
Go back!

702
00:31:46,360 --> 00:31:48,310
-What are you doing?
-Go back! Go back!

703
00:31:48,310 --> 00:31:49,920
Shapu!

704
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:50,590
Don't move! Stop!

705
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:51,440
Save Shapu!

706
00:31:52,550 --> 00:31:53,610
What are you doing?

707
00:31:53,880 --> 00:31:55,490
Do you even see me as your village chief?

708
00:31:55,490 --> 00:31:56,660
Acting chief.

709
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,350
I know.

710
00:32:02,110 --> 00:32:03,440
Guys,

711
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,600
I'll be honest with you.

712
00:32:06,030 --> 00:32:08,430
I've already had a wonderful conversation

713
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:11,920
with the chief of Chuanao Village.

714
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:14,880
We've agreed that

715
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:17,720
we'll compete and develop

716
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:19,920
fairly and peacefully.

717
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:23,340
This will be our basic policy.

718
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:24,840
If you mess with them,

719
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:27,510
you'll ruin this wonderful agreement!

720
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,180
Who's going to ruin it?

721
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,100
Do you know what we're going to do?

722
00:32:32,550 --> 00:32:33,880
What are you going to do?

723
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,110
Aren't you going to fight?

724
00:32:35,110 --> 00:32:36,170
Who wants to fight?

725
00:32:36,510 --> 00:32:37,970
What's the situation now?

726
00:32:38,030 --> 00:32:39,720
The sea monster is in Chuanao Village.

727
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,480
Where the sea monster is,

728
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:41,610
there are tourists.

729
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,160
That's right.

730
00:32:44,510 --> 00:32:47,510
The sea monster must be in Shapu Village!

731
00:32:47,510 --> 00:32:48,590
Yes!

732
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,780
W-What do you mean?

733
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:57,010
This is the suicide squad
I carefully selected.

734
00:32:58,070 --> 00:32:59,590
We're going to set sail,

735
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,480
jump into the sea,

736
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,470
and use ourselves as bait

737
00:33:05,550 --> 00:33:06,810
to lure the sea monster

738
00:33:07,270 --> 00:33:08,310
to Shapu Village.

739
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,450
Using ourselves as bait...

740
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:39,160
You're truly a hero!

741
00:33:59,440 --> 00:34:01,040
Have you thought it through?

742
00:34:01,070 --> 00:34:02,480
You want to join us?

743
00:34:04,800 --> 00:34:06,260
The duty of a village chief

744
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:09,190
is to save the villagers
from their misery.

745
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,360
And I'm going into the sea

746
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:16,260
to help the villagers get ashore.

747
00:34:17,800 --> 00:34:19,330
What if you don't come back?

748
00:34:20,230 --> 00:34:21,489
Then I won't come back!

749
00:34:26,070 --> 00:34:26,760
Okay.

750
00:34:33,550 --> 00:34:35,350
Smear duck blood on yourselves!

751
00:34:35,590 --> 00:34:37,719
It'll help us attract the sea monster!

752
00:34:38,070 --> 00:34:39,110
Take off your clothes!

753
00:34:39,110 --> 00:34:41,070
Shapu! Shapu!

754
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,340
What are you doing?

755
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:46,540
What are you doing?

756
00:34:46,710 --> 00:34:47,070
Zhen.

757
00:34:48,510 --> 00:34:49,760
We're going to attract the sea monster!

758
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,880
Attract the sea monster?

759
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:52,760
Is it appropriate for an acting chief
to fool around like this?

760
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:55,290
It's precisely because
I'm the acting chief.

761
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,929
Once the sea monster comes,

762
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:58,710
tourists will come,
and the economy will rise.

763
00:34:58,710 --> 00:35:00,760
Isn't this a way to attract investment?

764
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:01,890
You thought of this?

765
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:02,840
Was it you?

766
00:35:02,840 --> 00:35:03,760
Did you lead him astray?

767
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:04,230
Yes.

768
00:35:05,590 --> 00:35:07,360
We're going into the sea

769
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:09,690
to lure the monster to Shapu Village!

770
00:35:09,690 --> 00:35:10,000
I...

771
00:35:11,070 --> 00:35:12,800
What do you think you're doing?

772
00:35:13,230 --> 00:35:14,920
Do you think you're a hero?

773
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:16,520
Do you think you're so smart?

774
00:35:17,110 --> 00:35:18,970
I just want to prove myself to you.

775
00:35:19,070 --> 00:35:20,460
Is this how you prove yourself?

776
00:35:20,460 --> 00:35:22,650
What if something goes wrong

777
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:23,450
out at sea?

778
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,220
Then what should we do?

779
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,110
In this situation, what can we do?

780
00:35:32,110 --> 00:35:33,150
We have no choice but to risk our lives.

781
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:34,760
There's no other way!

782
00:35:35,550 --> 00:35:36,110
Fine.

783
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:38,190
So, you don't care about
your dignity anymore?

784
00:35:38,190 --> 00:35:38,760
No.

785
00:35:38,760 --> 00:35:39,480
You don't care about your life anymore?

786
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:40,070
No!

787
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:42,120
You don't care about me anymore?

788
00:35:47,070 --> 00:35:48,130
Alright, alright.

789
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:49,880
Everyone, just go home.

790
00:35:50,070 --> 00:35:51,000
Don't stay here.

791
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:52,710
Let's go back.

792
00:35:52,710 --> 00:35:53,770
Let's go. Let's go.

793
00:35:54,310 --> 00:35:55,500
Does it hurt?

794
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:02,760
Jiaoqi,

795
00:36:03,510 --> 00:36:05,510
where are we taking the sea monster?

796
00:36:07,030 --> 00:36:07,960
Go further away.

797
00:36:08,360 --> 00:36:10,590
Throw it into the deep sea
so it won't be discovered.

798
00:36:10,590 --> 00:36:11,000
Okay.

799
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:29,080
Mr. Maling, you're here too.

800
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:31,230
Z-Zhen,

801
00:36:31,230 --> 00:36:33,000
why are your pores so big?

802
00:36:34,150 --> 00:36:34,760
Sorry.

803
00:36:37,950 --> 00:36:38,950
Mr. Maling.

804
00:36:40,070 --> 00:36:42,670
I've encountered
a lot of difficulties recently.

805
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:44,710
I tried so hard to solve them,

806
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,280
but the harder I try,

807
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:48,070
the more I find that I can't

808
00:36:48,590 --> 00:36:49,850
accomplish anything.

809
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:52,070
I'm so useless.

810
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,590
That's how life is.

811
00:36:55,030 --> 00:36:57,030
We always encounter many problems.

812
00:36:58,110 --> 00:36:59,750
Does the universe have boundaries?

813
00:36:59,750 --> 00:37:01,270
Does time have an end?

814
00:37:01,810 --> 00:37:03,200
Just look on the bright side.

815
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:04,000
It'll be over.

816
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:06,800
Mr. Maling.

817
00:37:07,150 --> 00:37:08,630
I really envy you.

818
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:11,340
You always live in your own world.

819
00:37:12,670 --> 00:37:14,470
The small world is the big world,

820
00:37:14,510 --> 00:37:15,840
and vice versa.

821
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:18,480
From a cosmological perspective,

822
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:20,070
in the face of time,

823
00:37:20,070 --> 00:37:21,840
humans are nothing but tiny,

824
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:23,030
tailless mice,

825
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:25,280
flies, grasshoppers,

826
00:37:25,550 --> 00:37:26,280
and maggots.

827
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:29,450
When you're sad,
just look into the distance,

828
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,960
and you'll feel better.

829
00:37:37,500 --> 00:37:38,900
Mr. Maling, look at that!

830
00:37:39,110 --> 00:37:40,880
Does it look like the sea monster?

831
00:37:40,880 --> 00:37:43,150
If someone has a sea monster
in their heart,

832
00:37:43,150 --> 00:37:45,280
they can see the sea monster.

833
00:37:46,190 --> 00:37:47,120
This sea monster

834
00:37:47,590 --> 00:37:49,920
is my latest invention for our village...

835
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:52,030
Z-Zhen.

836
00:37:53,210 --> 00:37:54,690
Z-Zhen?

837
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,070
Zhen!

838
00:38:07,030 --> 00:38:07,550
Mr. Bing.

839
00:38:07,550 --> 00:38:08,630
There's a sea monster out at sea.

840
00:38:08,630 --> 00:38:09,590
That's fake.

841
00:38:09,590 --> 00:38:11,360
Mr. Bing, lend me the key.

842
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:13,000
Well, this too. Thank you.

843
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,800
-Wait...
-Thanks. Lend it to me.

844
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:17,400
Zhen, there's a sea monster!

845
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,400
Be careful!

846
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:44,030
Jiaoqi.

847
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,110
What is that?

848
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:52,740
Why is there another sea monster?

849
00:38:52,960 --> 00:38:53,800
Is this real?

850
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,240
Y-You made it?

851
00:38:55,630 --> 00:38:56,320
I didn't.

852
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:02,680
It sank?

853
00:39:03,130 --> 00:39:05,260
This sea monster can't swim.

854
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:07,150
It's just average,

855
00:39:07,150 --> 00:39:08,360
not as good as ours.

856
00:39:19,510 --> 00:39:20,730
Why is there a boat?

857
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:21,850
What's going on?

858
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:24,150
There's a boat.

859
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:25,610
And someone's driving it.

860
00:39:26,110 --> 00:39:26,590
It's...

861
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:31,610
-Zhen?
-Zhen!

862
00:39:31,970 --> 00:39:32,480
Zhen!

863
00:39:32,710 --> 00:39:33,440
Run! Run!

864
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:35,670
Don't run!

865
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:41,510
Hurry!

866
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:47,420
Why is she driving so fast?

867
00:39:47,670 --> 00:39:49,440
She's a fisherwoman, okay?

868
00:39:53,970 --> 00:39:55,400
Well, cleaning lady,

869
00:39:55,590 --> 00:39:56,880
even if I checked out of the hotel,

870
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:57,760
you should've kept it for me

871
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:58,710
to come and get it.

872
00:39:58,710 --> 00:39:59,800
It's not a hotel.

873
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:02,480
Didn't you say it was a themed room?

874
00:40:02,670 --> 00:40:04,590
Sir, you stayed in a warehouse.

875
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:08,700
And they charged me 380 yuan a day.

876
00:40:09,180 --> 00:40:10,510
They deceived you, sir.

877
00:40:12,510 --> 00:40:13,510
It's not important.

878
00:40:13,510 --> 00:40:14,710
Can you find my luggage?

879
00:40:14,710 --> 00:40:15,400
Nothing else matters.

880
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,510
Can you help me find

881
00:40:16,510 --> 00:40:17,920
the nunchucks,

882
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:19,110
the ones made from a wooden stick?

883
00:40:19,110 --> 00:40:20,030
That's very important to me.

884
00:40:20,030 --> 00:40:21,510
Okay, I'll definitely find them.

885
00:40:21,510 --> 00:40:22,440
-Can you find them?
-Yes.

886
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,770
Okay. Thank you so much.

887
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:28,960
Sea monster!

888
00:40:30,030 --> 00:40:30,760
Sea monster?

889
00:40:31,190 --> 00:40:32,030
Well, thank you.

890
00:40:32,030 --> 00:40:33,110
If you find them, please tell me.

891
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:34,000
I'm Caixia.

892
00:40:34,000 --> 00:40:34,760
-Okay.
-I'm Caixia.

893
00:40:34,760 --> 00:40:35,820
Thank you, Caixia.

894
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,190
Zhen?

895
00:40:43,850 --> 00:40:45,380
Zhen, don't chase it! Zhen!

896
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:51,100
Bro, is this your boat?

897
00:40:51,230 --> 00:40:51,590
Yes.

898
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:52,360
Thanks.

899
00:40:52,460 --> 00:40:52,920
Wait...

900
00:40:53,030 --> 00:40:53,840
Who are you?

901
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:58,760
She's coming!

902
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:07,920
Zhen!

903
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:13,190
I can't drive anymore, Jiaoqi!

904
00:41:13,190 --> 00:41:14,030
Over there!

905
00:41:15,550 --> 00:41:17,030
Zhen!

906
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:18,370
Don't come over!

907
00:41:18,400 --> 00:41:19,960
I'm coming to save you!

908
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,450
Zhou Ke?

909
00:41:21,480 --> 00:41:22,230
Go!

910
00:41:27,230 --> 00:41:28,140
Don't come over!
